<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Slime Slaying Online RPG - AUTO AFK FARM BOSS</Major>
    <Description>RUN AFTER KILLING BOSS

REQUIREMENTS: MUST HAVE ENOUGH DAMAGE TO ONE SHOT THE BOSS + SET KEYBINDING TO SKILL KEYBIND</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>//TURN ON AFTER KILLING BOSS
Delay 31 s
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 2 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>